  {system: "SGLang RadixAttention", url: "https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2024-01-17-sglang/", overlap: "automatic KV cache reuse across multi-call LLM programs; overlaps with exploiting repeated prefixes in agent-like workflows, not the reported mass decomposition"},
